   "post_caption": "Here is a compilation of all publicly available footage from the super-giga-secret Trump documentary filmed in 2020.\n\nSomeday, every American history class will watch this footage and be able to see these antidemocratic shitlords and excoriate them for their blind affirmation of the endless cascade of obvious lies that the notorious obvious liar has and continues to tell. While there is no possibility that trump ever faces any criminal prosecution…it’s nice to know this nonsense was captured in such a glorious and unmistakable grift for the historic record. \n\nIt’s bizarre nobody found out until now that a documentary team was embedded with the trump campaign from September 2020 until he left office but it was confirmed when the Jan 6 select committee subpoenaed the footage and a few clips have been released.  \n\nPreserving this unhinged shit for the historic record is a blessing and inshallah the big boy president says as much stupid and legally perilous stuff as I’m expecting him to. You KNOW this megalomaniac was yapping aimlessly about how unfairly he was being treated after 1/6 and taking a yak being banned from twitter.",
